#: scenario3:scenario3_C9E97BEC_821B_49B4_AD75_726CCF04AEA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 334613971f371a5d59cbd55b3f822259ed87acbda569c5bc1ce5543e5d660fc7
#. default-sha256: 1dad9e27a82abf2dbb5e73945cc7201930e23116961e57e14387fbc748279b55
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C9E97BEC_821B_49B4_AD75_726CCF04AEA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ah, they have grown to be so "
"beautiful..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ah, elles sont devenues si belles..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5D915F34_3442_4BDA_9B75_EA6963124549
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac8b7d75feeb8d6b6fc89f7e2a491c606d00a52ee1f6cffad54e03adbfb27ecd
#. default-sha256: cd46f95ffbbde868f3679672767e2e7e5808880074da682214cce94523545c7a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5D915F34_3442_4BDA_9B75_EA6963124549"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Such a wonderful fragrance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The scent of roses is so calming.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wonder why "
"that is..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quel parfum enivrant.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le parfum des roses est tellement apaisant.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Je me "
"demande pourquoi..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D68FB132_36D1_43CB_8AC1_FBDE0EF33E34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcc59a4508bb00444f7e362795f7377bb7252a4c0045f2d1e7d77ea5482c51c3
#. default-sha256: db5e86b4bc42c13fc5e6cf6e584ef841a85481285994ff8b7963640352142a26
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D68FB132_36D1_43CB_8AC1_FBDE0EF33E34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Would it cause any trouble if I picked one?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Est-ce que cela ne vous dérange pas si j’en cueille une ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B7634D2_4B4F_4508_8561_EF1B27F9F49C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0d662c6c949ad76eeb3e72e9465f6981a2625993d1acaf1855b2b2a3a0f74c9
#. default-sha256: d8aab1c2eb4c2206901e8891ef6e6f9aa5989d1fc8a8acf03ab37df03a3d216b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B7634D2_4B4F_4508_8561_EF1B27F9F49C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, hello there. Out for a midnight stroll, are you?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Quite the peculiar "
"hobby... ⟪k:4⟫“Madam”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, salutations. Vous êtes sortie vous promener au clair de lune ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vous avez "
"des loisirs plutôt étonnants... ⟪k:4⟫« madame » ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5A3AB145_58BD_41A4_8A2F_2FB5A8C21D76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f06a8fa7b55a7d01911fbe1f34f7a2aeb7bdd23140df21c0a8d5fa01c98f841c
#. default-sha256: 82f8a9c3238881e39d10dd925a83b5c72a7400c219273980c9730113e5a398eb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5A3AB145_58BD_41A4_8A2F_2FB5A8C21D76"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫U-⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Um, ⟪k:5⟫I cannot spend as much time as I would like outside during "
"the day, so I end up coming out at night...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I apologize if I startled you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E-⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Euh, ⟪k:5⟫je ne peux pas passer autant de temps que je voudrais dehors "
"durant la journée, alors je finis par sortir de nuit...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Veuillez m’excuser si cela vous "
"a surprise."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F04C7A2F_4D50_486F_B1A4_9A351110B7F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85ec533995ea15e3622e26e238e4346be340bb4b8df64cbaa1d229aa6ad0f42d
#. default-sha256: 7d62ee2a3762fecf85eb594a99130fbefcd386a74a7bd2903765181116677dc3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F04C7A2F_4D50_486F_B1A4_9A351110B7F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh no, not at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh non, pas du tout."

#: scenario3:scenario3_89149FFE_056C_40EC_AA10_89D8B6933C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 191c5821922902279dbc25e648302cf3eb10a1b3868b2222bd5d4a4047eb9d91
#. default-sha256: 5bbe0e2bd2137446e34f28d7053cdb39230e060fb4e5629aaeefcfe96f7596fe
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_89149FFE_056C_40EC_AA10_89D8B6933C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is a chilling, captivating beauty to the sight of your snow-white form standing "
"there in the moonlit garden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Votre silhouette d’un blanc neige, debout, dans le jardin au clair de lune... cela ne "
"manque pas de beauté : on en est comme captivé, c’est à vous donner des frissons."

#: scenario3:scenario3_457BC5E0_624E_43E9_B1BB_AF87D2552128
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d5b97f6b0cd6462548da19faf82f66564a7b1d35c6768f2032953e81ab81a8a
#. default-sha256: 7a113b4c30ebe66071734c9a4c392a89cd8cff36df3f91a8923e9b7999548571
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_457BC5E0_624E_43E9_B1BB_AF87D2552128"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would hardly...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Um, ⟪k:4⟫what are you doing out so late?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je ne...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Euh, ⟪k:4⟫que faites-vous ici à cette heure-ci ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_654A59B7_5584_42CD_9134_31C48EE1A8E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc2a37b605204ca1dc79747c1e10ddebef0ab0c544314454ec2460404c6b492c
#. default-sha256: b7754ad1670ac4983a81fabd79eaa6646013a27649321073c7fce3caa981cc04
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_654A59B7_5584_42CD_9134_31C48EE1A8E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I saw a figure through the window.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫On the slight chance it might be a burglar,"
"⟪k:4⟫I thought it my responsibility to ensure they did not break in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫J’ai vu quelqu’un passer par la fenêtre.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je me suis dit que si c’était un "
"cambrioleur,⟪k:4⟫il valait mieux m’assurer qu’il ne pénètre pas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4935B276_EA74_4831_A52A_A645C452BEFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb2a4b52dfc340953d078153c13797699300d0c4d11cec3ee87f520d04af9ab4
#. default-sha256: 0dce8ae1b21311b2e0c24396c47144491305af02255f5c0a484ce58f52fb0813
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4935B276_EA74_4831_A52A_A645C452BEFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was also the middle of the night when the grocer’s servant broke into their safe."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’était aussi le milieu de la nuit quand le serviteur de l’épicier a pénétré dans leur "
"coffre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_34E7DCF2_024B_4C97_9867_2F839ECB2D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb622281b03f5515482e95bf251a4bd8ba67814f704a56d1602bcea833072942
#. default-sha256: b70702d2e0df2b4427bf4fa4e67659085a9876339b8aab9f116f666f8cc99bcb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_34E7DCF2_024B_4C97_9867_2F839ECB2D7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫News of that spread quite far; I am sure you would have heard about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les nouvelles sont allées vite ; je suis sûre que vous en avez entendu parler."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FCBA1534_5D4C_424D_BE7E_ED0CADCEA75C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63d48132a6b469c33d45d2a1dff065283af36bd2b06cdbbb0b43826c9ead4345
#. default-sha256: 8d3665ce64e11954e6697d29a789e1c7dfe662e1a81b4cd78fae99d8596bf6e6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FCBA1534_5D4C_424D_BE7E_ED0CADCEA75C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, but Gemasch was imprisoned some time ago.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dear me, cannot seem to get my "
"head out of the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, pardon, Gemasch a été emprisonné il y a un certain temps, déjà.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ciel, je "
"n’arrive pas à me sortir le passé de la tête."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F52C227_20CD_45C3_A885_8AEE78228065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 615281537579d8884dcc650d844f76aef6360f13b68ae87e42ea85f0f86b5212
#. default-sha256: 6377acf9c1618dbb867e5b6a2b41edefe75e503a6a4aac14378ba4877aa73205
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F52C227_20CD_45C3_A885_8AEE78228065"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫U-⟪k:2⟫Um...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E-⟪k:2⟫Euh... ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A11ABC1_4B20_4CFC_994B_F02E1B694F3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e192ffeb552a31bb6eb6cdfc3c44128b321aaa3d09ee65538d3b8d988e279e4
#. default-sha256: 505ddda86773e335ef7f77e866dcdb610a120a028e1a39e351f8eea3c741c1d5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A11ABC1_4B20_4CFC_994B_F02E1B694F3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you intend to give that white rose to someone?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Comptez-vous donner cette rose blanche à quelqu’un en particulier ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E5C62BCD_F9BF_44B3_8771_5B061984E998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d81288674ec43c1ce44e321714585bd5b5bfcad18b31811502250c652fb77ae1
#. default-sha256: 159f1a26a7d6cdc450a491b07b373654a175ef0269de86f2c7e1798f0bbfae46
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E5C62BCD_F9BF_44B3_8771_5B061984E998"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Y-⟪k:2⟫Yes. ⟪k:3⟫I was thinking about giving it to my husband."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...O-⟪k:2⟫Oui. ⟪k:3⟫Je pensais la donner à mon époux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D451EF29_CB72_4698_80BB_220487F7C951
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0954c93ffa12a7ecf5ba3f02d1457193ad3d9ea59511e842377c61aa0a3ed783
#. default-sha256: 87a24a47ef08dc8f70be7a0957d217db6eaf2a2bd1163f18d6ffeaa44e62c23c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D451EF29_CB72_4698_80BB_220487F7C951"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫While I expect he has little fondness for such feminine tastes,⟪k:2⟫the scent of "
"flowers has a truly calming effect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Même si je m’attends à ce qu’il ait peu d’intérêt pour des goûts aussi féminins, je me "
"dis que le parfum des fleurs a vraiment un effet apaisant."

#: scenario3:scenario3_80E6097D_BFF6_4A01_8208_FD02904C8D07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a25308c8e34d9c362ed96028cce2003c59316964cf8977fc7a26e3e08f73446c
#. default-sha256: ad4e7bd243502d278f04fb91c5141845c13bc8991967a0a703f9806f4c5255b1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80E6097D_BFF6_4A01_8208_FD02904C8D07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He might find it relaxing when he needs a reprieve from his work..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il le trouvera peut-être relaxant lorsqu’il éprouvera le besoin de faire une pause dans son "
"travail..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_01AF9E8B_AB0B_4FA1_8698_083235499A79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98682a7611c1926378e2757f94370d24593fc6cbbc11da659d4c20a048dfa6bb
#. default-sha256: 65d730d1e242730157290c4f16749cd919859248eb61854784909129eaa04245
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01AF9E8B_AB0B_4FA1_8698_083235499A79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, is that so?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You are very kindhearted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah oui ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vous avez vraiment bon cœur."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9531573C_F950_4C64_B994_3D6AAD50D1D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4d0d51923b06812a477d66193c5f796e515676b164731a91663bd17abc2098e
#. default-sha256: c331e231eabf922c913fc835c401e26b624f43ce91586d5b6f02b9ebfb9feb94
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9531573C_F950_4C64_B994_3D6AAD50D1D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Speaking of white roses, the rose he meant to give you was the same shade of white."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫En parlant de roses blanches, la rose qu’il voulait vous donner était de la même teinte "
"de blanc."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6003C6F8_58E3_45C3_AA57_561D9C9D7424
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d60b62f6a361ed4e82fa2c813efe0574ad951ce46f35dac460d2e2b8df49b566
#. default-sha256: d42b98697000457b2c34c0cc88b923a3dadc36bae1e8daeef0f59d035fba34a3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6003C6F8_58E3_45C3_AA57_561D9C9D7424"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? “He”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah ? « Il » ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C64D774_C5B1_447B_AAFF_C2DF2C458337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97b5c0f13fbbb6c89444c68ceef51153efb6de96859a09d179e9de9d1b372555
#. default-sha256: b81abbaf834dc27151bc62cc395876efa01023fa12e9ccde0d556b54c9108041
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C64D774_C5B1_447B_AAFF_C2DF2C458337"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But when you touched it, it turned a deep shade of red."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais quand vous l’avez touchée, elle est passée à un rouge profond."

#: scenario3:scenario3_586CF5EF_B1B9_43E5_87C7_70D5D1557952
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22dad34ce468213855f91416bb1b9ee2b293a8984ab20f79a9691c11f6ac5664
#. default-sha256: ab7bc79cdd2039005b4de9209a5b55601c9d57f4855e9af20cbc66550626dca2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_586CF5EF_B1B9_43E5_87C7_70D5D1557952"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫There was but a single white rose in the garden,⟪k:25⟫"
"so he was unable to give it to you as he had wished.⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫In its place, he had a decorative "
"rose fashioned for you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Il n’y avait qu’une seule rose blanche dans le jardin,"
"⟪k:25⟫donc il s’est retrouvé dans l’incapacité de vous l’offrir comme il l’avait souhaité.⟪k:26⟫ "
"⟪k:27⟫À⟪k:28⟫ la place, il a fait faire une rose en bijou pour vous."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D4A9BCE_6B49_490E_A0EA_E8F4D28BE8C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17ebca78a673aa027c630eac1e281f4e95026bea2eccb54c4633c9f5eb3a3ec5
#. default-sha256: 62489c344cc488e8f99ad4af8324e7ba5cdbaa50da5d1a508465883a1c42e0e8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D4A9BCE_6B49_490E_A0EA_E8F4D28BE8C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫U-⟪k:3⟫Um, what exactly are you referring to?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E-⟪k:3⟫Euh, de quoi parlez-vous, au juste ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_19D477A7_AE3D_49E4_AFC6_CA8316B0C73F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 554b9314eb89c6f84996a7be9bfdfd637bcd0cf622f989772c2817308173ec47
#. default-sha256: c905a6d77615ed3fd7faa8ba4a5a1c72386327322c81f12cc807e11dab3a309e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_19D477A7_AE3D_49E4_AFC6_CA8316B0C73F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh dear. Do you not remember?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh ciel. Vous ne vous souvenez pas ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B478897_8F03_49D5_AF85_494B5627FA4B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
